    "detailed_description": "welcome to BAD END THEATER! <br>select your protagonist and explore a variety of terrible fates! <br><br>the decisions you make in one story will affect the others. you can toggle these behaviors to open up new paths! unfortunately, every path leads to a bad ending... <br><br>can you find a way to save this unlucky cast? <br><br>playtime: 1-3 hours to see all endings (it's a puzzle game, so this varies widely)<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FEATURES</h2> 16k words, 600 illustrations, 40+ endings<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">CREDITS</h2> <br>story + art + music - NomnomNami <br>animation - chunderfins<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">TRANSLATION</h2> <br>Espa\u00f1ol (LATAM) - Jos\u00e9 Jil Tudela<br>Espa\u00f1ol (ES), Euskara - Gabriel Fiallegas Medina (Basajaun Games)<br>Fran\u00e7ais - Yuri Akuto<br>Deutsch - Marshmelie<br>Italiano - Rypher<br>Nederlands - Demi<br>Portugu\u00eas (BR) - Fah Braccini<br>Polski - Nika Klag<br>\u010ce\u0161tina - David &quot;Dejw136&quot; Ben\u00e1\u010dek<br>Magyar - Diemond<br>Svenska - Felix Hindemo<br>\u0420\u0443\u0441\u0441\u043a\u0438\u0439 - Zweelee<br>\ud55c\uad6d\uc5b4 - KyleHeren<br>\u7b80\u4f53\u4e2d\u6587 - Yuriatelier<br>\u65e5\u672c\u8a9e - Lin YuFan, Katsuhide, Sota<br>Ti\u1ebfng Vi\u1ec7t - B\u00e1nh<br>T\u00fcrk\u00e7e - Ebru Nilay Vural<br>\u0627\u0644\u0639\u0631\u0628\u064a\u0629 - Montassar Ghanmi<br>\u05e2\u05d1\u05e8\u05d9\u05ea - swagster2000<br>\u0e20\u0e32\u0e29\u0e32\u0e44\u0e17\u0e22 - Whateverzone<br>\u0423\u043a\u0440\u0430\u0457\u043d\u0441\u044c\u043a\u0430 - storyteller613<br>\u0395\u03bb\u03bb\u03b7\u03bd\u03b9\u03ba\u03ac - Theangelknight",
